  "_comment": [
    "Languages with status 'built' have a full dictionary in assets/i18n and are",
    "published as real pages under /<code>/. Languages with status 'planned' are",
    "prepared here — code, locale, direction, native label, slugs — but are NOT",
    "published, because publishing an English page under a foreign URL is a",
    "duplicate, not a translation. Adding one is: translate the strings into",
    "assets/i18n/<code>.js, add its slugs and SEO text, flip status to 'built',",
    "run the build. Nothing else changes."
